{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>面對日夜顛倒或每週變動的輪班工作，普通鬧鐘往往難以應付複雜的排班需求。《Bonus Alarm》專為不規則作息設計，能自動識別當週班次並精準喚醒，現正提供<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載，是輪班人員與排班制工作者的必備工具。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-239.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智慧辨識班次動態調整</h2>\n<p>支援自定義輪班模式，可建立「兩日兩夜」等循環並設定各時段鬧鈴時間。具備單次跳過功能，休假時無需刪除整個排程，其餘日子照常運作。內建奇偶數週區分、特定日期提醒及節假日暫停模式，確保在任何生活節奏下都能準時起床。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-286-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-287-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-288-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-289-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-290-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-291-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Bonus Alarm: Smart Alarm Clock</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/bonus-alarm-smart-alarm-clock/id6760178748?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:15:30.153241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:49:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:37:36.005416+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:09:00.802509+00:00","content_hash":"cb5363618209a26f571e9685ff1bb170e2e32114c528e9a10d8105b5dd78660b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}